{"TrueBusterExpert","\cmTrue \cuBusterExpert","M_UB000","Super Street Fighter 2 - M. Bison's Theme","\ckUse your primary to fire a single Buster Shot!\n\cdUse your alt for a Sweeper Shot.\n\cnUse your item to dash ahead!\n\cjThe \cghelltatoru \cjwill help you if it's your \cglast resort...","",""},
{"HunterHawkeye","\cmHunter \crHawkeye","M_UB001","Super Street Fighter 2 - T. Hawk's Theme","\ckYour primary is a rail gun!\n\cdUse your alt to zoom in and deal extra damage!\n\cnUse your item for an Exit Unit!","",""},
{"DonJavier","\cmDon \ckJavier","M_UB002","Super Street Fighter 2 - Vega's Theme","\cnUse your item to throw knives!\n\ckUse your primary to dash and slice!\n\cdUse your alt to climb walls.","",""},
{"ElitistSue","\cmElitist \cnSue","M_UB003","Marvel Vs Capcom 1 - Morrigan's Theme (Sped Up)","\ckUse your primary to blast enemies with a chill!\n\cnYour item lets you fly for a bit!\n\cdUse your alt to fire an energy-catching needle for empowered attacks.","",""},
{"ColonelKachidonga","\cmColonel \cgKachidonga","M_UB004","F-Zero (Fire Field)","\ckUse your primary to fire a cannonball!\n\cdOr use your alt to fire some buckshots!\n\cnUse item for \cvLASER\cn!","",""},
{"KakusaretaSutoka","\cmKakusareta \chSutoka","M_UB005 3","Shadow of Ninja (NES) - Stage 2","You have many ninja tools at your disposal...\n\cnUse your item to swap your \ckprimary\cn and \cdalt\cn weapons and play around with them!\n\cjYour \cgrage\cj generates Pandora Boxes!","",""},
{"OfficerJohnson","\cmOfficer \cqJohnson","M_UB006","Marvel vs. Capcom 1 - Captain America's Theme","\ckUse your primary to fire your riot shotgun.\n\cdUse your alt for Justice Slam!","",""},
{"ElitistWaylon","\cmHurricane \ctWaylon","M_UB007","Super Street Fighter 2 - Fei Long's Theme (American)","\ckYour primary sends your enemies the punishing gift of wind!\n\cdUse your alt for Peus Anti-Ground!","",""},
{"ShinHellbot","\cmShin \cuHellbot","M_UB008","Super Street Fighter 2 - Akuma's Theme","I can't control the Helltatoru...\nMy powers may be great, but I must serve as its vessel.\nI could always \cdalt\cj to escape if needed...","",""},
{"CaptainDevilEye","\chDevileye","M_UB009","Art of Fighting - Mr. Big's Theme (SNES)","\ckUse your primary to blast insistent enemies with fireballs.\n\cdUse your alt to do a burning upper!\n\cnYour item tosses a sack of money to hire allies!","B","was ranked up to become a"},
//10
{"TricksterGiovanni","\cmTrickster \cjGiovanni","M_UB010","Streets of Rage 2 - Ready Funk","\ckUse your primary to fire a cluster of explosives!\n\cnUse your item to pull a random trick!\n\cdYour alt grants temporary invisibility!","",""},
{"IronCurtain","\cmIron \cdCurtain","M_UB011","Final Fight One GBA - Rolento's Theme","Destroy them all!\n\cdYour attacks are affected by your ammo reserves...","",""},
{"CaptainBlitzkrieg","\cmCaptain \ciBlitzkrieg","M_UB012","Punchout Wii!! - Vs. Von Kaiser","\ckUse your primary to show your patients how to be sharp!\n\cdUse your alt to make them screw off!","",""},
{"DicksterDick","\cmDickster \cdDick","M_UB013","Wario Land 3 - Final Boss (Sped-up)","H-Heh... They will never catch me! I'm so fast and light, they will never see me c-coming.\nI can dodge everything with my \ckprimary\cj and jump higher with my \cdsecondary\cj...","Ek!","Oh no! it's"},//\ckOh no! it's \cmDickster \cdDick\c-!
{"SovietFrostBite","\cmSoviet \cnFrostbite","M_UB014","Alan Parsons Project - Cask of Amontillado (Sped-Up)","Eliminate all hostiles, for the motherland!\n\ckUse your primary to blast enemies with a chill!\n\cdGive them the cold shoulder with your alt!","",""},
{"SovietIgniter","\cmSoviet \ciIgniter","M_UB014","Alan Parsons Project - Cask of Amontillado (Sped-Up)","Eliminate all hostiles, for the motherland!\n\ckUse your primary to torch your enemies!\n\cdYour alt can unleash a fireball spread and turn all into ash!","",""},
{"RepairManEdward","\cmRepairman \cfEdward","M_UB016","Gundam Wing Endless Duel (SNES) - Arctic","\ckRepair people's faces with your primary!\n\cdYour alt attack can shock people around you!","",""},
{"RNCClashman","\cuRNC \ctClashman","M_UB017 12","Nettou King of Fighters 96 - Mr. Karate theme","\ckUse your primary and fire under your enemies if you can!\n\cdUse your alt to let loose a deadly bomb that can drop from ceilings!","",""},
{"ArchArcanist","\ctArch \cmArcanist","M_UB018","Final Fantasy Legend II SNES Mix - Boss Battle - Dreadful Battle","\cuThe time has come to release terror into people's lives. \n\cnThe item ability swaps magic sets.\n\cjEach spell has their uses...","C","approaches"},
{"MeguhMang","\chMeguh Mang","*","None","\ckYour primary fires an exploding shot where you aim!\n\cdUse your alt for \ciRAWSH COIL\cd!","",""},
