{"YellowHero","\ckYellow Anti-Unholy Elite","M_UB038X","FamiPico 3 - Frozen Mountain (Power Rangers: The Movie)","Defeat all the other players!\n\ciYou have high speed!","",""},
{"PurpleHero","\ctPurple Anti-Unholy Elite","M_UB038X","FamiPico 3 - Frozen Mountain (Power Rangers: The Movie)","Defeat all the other players!\n\ciYou have spread shooting!","",""},
{"Faggasso","\ccSpeciman","M_UB042 5","Earthbound Beginnings - Battle Against a Dangerous Foe","THE ECONOMY LACKS ESTABLISHMENT. To save the economy, kill anti-economic people. \ckAssume\cj a blast that explodes! \cdAssume\cj a shield that protects! \cnAssume\cj a flash that does something!","C","draws near"},
{"RedFaggasso","\cgRed Speciman","M_UB042 5","Earthbound Beginnings - Battle Against a Dangerous Foe","THE OVEN IS \cgBURNING\cj. To save the oven, annihilate fridge-fanatics. \ckAssume\cj a chargeable fire shot! \cdAssume\cj a little eruption of fire! \cnAssume\cj a flash that does something!","C","draws near"},
{"BlueFaggasso","\chBlue Speciman","M_UB042 5","Earthbound Beginnings - Battle Against a Dangerous Foe","THE FRIDGE IS \chRUNNING\cj. To save the fridge, annihilate oven-lovers. \ckAssume\cj a freezing explosive which can be detonated manually! \cdAssume\cj a quick teleport! \cnAssume\cj a flash that does something!","C","draws near"},
{"YellowFaggasso","\cfYellow Speciman","M_UB042 5","Earthbound Beginnings - Battle Against a Dangerous Foe","THE LAUNDRY-MACHINE IS \ckMALFUNCTIONING\cj. To save the laundry-machine, annihilate coathangers. \ckAssume\cj a deadly thunder attack, It might miss! \cdAssume\cj annoying stun! \cnAssume\cj a flash that does something!","C","draws near"},
{"GutsBuddy","\ciGuts Buddy","M_UB046 6","River City Ransom (NES) - A Tough Fight","\ciDun Dunnnnn!. \cjYou are \ciGuts Buddy\cj, help people! \n\ckThrow a rock! \n\cdOr punch people! \n\cnOr even cause a quake!","C","appears"},
{"RussianGuts","\cvRussian \ccGutsman","M_UB047","Skyward Sword - Stalmaster Battle","I come to destroy capitalist land, is nice. \n\ckPick up boulders with primary clicking button, click again to throw them.\n\cdSecondary clicking button punches sad loser, very good.\n\cjMighty communist force of grabbing boulder and then hitting \cdpunch\cj button \nwill allow me to \cdtoss boulder\cj up to sky. \cdPunch\cj tossed boulder to obliterate foes.\nOnce my wrath hits it's boiling point, is time to initiate \cgDeathblow\c- throw.","C","appears"},
{"RedeadGuts","\cqRedead \ccGutsman","M_UB048","Zombies Ate My Neighbors - Evening of the Undead","To be replaced by tetrimos is humiliating.\nTo be forgotten is worse than death.\nBut I awaken once more, to get the job done.\nBack at it again \ckthrowing\cj out boulders with my greater arm.\n\cdRam\cj and \cnslam\cj back at the construction sites.\nI might be slow, but I'm \cidetermined\cj to get revenge.","C","reawakens"},
{"Troutius","\ciTroutius","M_UB049","Pokemon Sun & Moon - Battle! Gladion (Bulby's cover)","It's not a phase.\nI \ckshoot\cj, I \cdkick\cj and deny society because I'm Troutius.\nYou don't control my life, I make my own decisions because I am the edge of the night.\nSharp enough, it makes me crawl in my skin.","Ck.","appears, because yes"},
//50
{"HalfPressHardman","\ckHalfPress \chHardman","M_UB050","Shadic64 - Super Hardman 64 (Sped-up)","\ckMainfire to give them the ol' one-two combo.\n\cdAltfire for a super press; more air time for more power.\n\cgRage to warp onto a random player.","C","returns again"},
{"WarrockStelar","\cdWarrock Stelar","M_UB051","Megaman Starforce 1 - Ride On","My name is (You don't need to remember), Geo Stelar, age 15.\nThe past month to me is only my father disappearing while \nworking in the satellite that brings really exciting and worrying days.\n\nUntil I met this space dog.......\n\n\ckFire bullets, don't fire to build up power!\n\cdCreate a shield to block things!\n\cnThe ability to use a sword up-close!","",""},
{"HarpStrumm","\cdHarp Strumm","M_UB051","Megaman Starforce 1 - Ride On","Haha, wow! Are we in the battlefield now?\nLet's blast their ears with some tunes they'll never forget!\nTons of genres to play! Pick one and knock them dead!\nFrom here, we'll be a **\ca**shooting star **\c-**!","",""},
{"TidalTito_Boss","\cvTidal \chTito","M_UB053","Crash Bandicoot 2: N-Tranced - Wakeboard","'Ey brotha, \cvTidal \chTito \c-here.\nWould you like to know the ways of the ocean? Good.\nIt ebbs and flows, just like my heart.\n\cfWeak but quick \c-at its lowest, \cgstrong yet slow \c-at its highest.\nA surfer's soul resonates with this, remember that always.","",""},
{"VoidWalker","\ctVoid Walker","M_UB054","Final Fantasy 4 Advance - Boss Theme","I am a wanderer of the void, nowhere important.\nI have mastered the elements, test this power with care. (M1/M2)\nI might need all four to win, maybe... (Item)\nNow... \ctEn-Garde!","",""},
{"CrazedGrenademan","\cgCrazed \ciGrenademan","M_UB055","Super Mario RPG - Docaty Mountain Railroad","What'll it be, fellas? Carnage or Chaos? \nThere ain't a choice for anyone cause they mean the same thin'! \nSo how 'bout we light up this 'ere fuses and paint the town red? \nThen we can celebrate with a dance where we both clash heads, I ain't dazed I swear it! \nWith a bit more \camoonshine\c-, I'm sure these explosives will be even more pretty...",/*Spawn Letter*/"",/*Spawn Message*/""},
{"MorshuBoss","\cqMorshu","M_UB056","Wario: Master of Disguise - Boss Theme (Slightly Sped Up)","It's time to get richer!\nBombs on the M1, you want it?\nLamp oil molotov cocktails? It's yours, on the M2.\nRope? It's an item, you'll have to give me CREDIT.","",""},
{"TheCommandoChamp","\cdThe \cqCommando \cdCHAMP","M_UB057","The King of Fighters '98 - Rumbling on the City (Slightly Faster)","Are you a bad enough dude?\nAuthorized command to initiate \cgOperation Deathblow\c-.\nFire the missiles and scatter the mines.\nCapture hostiles and show them basic illegal CQC.\nBe the ideal patriot, today.","",""},
{"JoeOfDuty","\cqJoe","M_UB058","Advance Wars: Days of Ruin - Days of Ruin (slightly altered)","Note from HQ to \cqJoe\c-.\nGun down armed hostiles at all costs.\nYou are efficient at close quarters.\nDon't pick fights you can't win.\nAnd remember the main objective...\n\nKill \cgHitler\c-.","",""},
{"Balrog_Boss","\ciBalrog","M_UB059","Cave Story - Eyes of Flame (Parabeetle X's cover)","\cgHUZZAH!\c- Oh Yeaaaaah! \nLet's get to the point. I grab people, they die. \nI hover up and fire missiles and they die. \nAnd I can just pick them off with these basic projectiles. \nIs this in-character? Probably not, but I don't care!"},
//60
{"Misery_Boss","\cdMisery","M_UB059","Cave Story - Eyes of Flame (Parabeetle X's cover)","\ccOh, what a bother. Not THIS again... \n\c-Let's get to the point. I prefer if people weren't in my proximity. \nI can channel more energy to cast upon a deadlier spell, just enough to really get them out of my sight. \nOr how about just making sure they stay six feet under? Or obliterating them into nothing but ashes. \nFufufu...","",""},
{"ChieftainTomahawk","\ciChieftain Tomahawk","M_UB061","Mario Golf: Advanced Tour - Dunes Club Doubles Match (Sped up)","Trespassers beware! \nWe have grown weary enough to take action and repel those who threaten us. \nFor I take the mantle as \ciChieftain\c- and the tool for this is the almighty tomahawk...","",""},
{"Toronto_California","\ccAgent TorCal","M_UB062","Streets of Rage 2 - Never Return Alive","Infiltration success. \nThis isn't fantasy, it's real life. I've no need for a gun when I got my own hand. \nI got the tactical gear to stay out of enemy sight and catch them by surprise. \nBut just how many times can I undo my mistake-- Mistakes? No... \nI'm the best there is.","",""},
{"Plasma_Spark_Boss","\cdPlasma \cjSpark","M_UB063","Alien Vs. Predator (SNES) - City","There's never enough energy to burn. At least, I think...? \nI'm able to build up power just by moving around, enough to fire a shocking projectile. The more, the better. \nDon't get too close or it'll be a electrifying revelation to you that I can fry you! \nI'm not a villain or anything, I'm just on my way to work... at Walmart.","",""},
{"MeisterWahwee_Boss","\ctMeister \cjWahwee","M_UB064","The King of Fighters '94 - Getsutou R&D","Ze plan of zuday vill not faild. \nZe are surprises voh zem. A vather, \ckshocking\c- surprise. \nVonce ze mecha iz thrashed... ze gears will ve in motion...","",""},
{"Boss_Demoneye65","\ctDemoneye","M_UB065","Kirby Superstar (SNES) - Gladiator Kirby","\cd+ \cjFighting for a paycheck\n\cg- \cjDying to a paycut","",""},
