{"HellBot","\c[UB100]HellBot","M_UB100","Earthbound - Giygas Form 2","My power... I will show them all the \cgHelltatoru\cj.\n\cmBut...can I really control it?\n\cdMy alt shows the true power of the Raging Demon, yet my armor can only do so much...","Eg!","ALL SEVEN SINS COMBINE TO SUMMON"},
{"CXAirman","\chCXAirman","M_UB101 13","Rockman CX - Boss theme (Keitai Denjuu Telefang - Boss Battle)","\ckYour primary shoots 3 bullets in a spread formation.\n\cdAlt is your \cgrage\cd. It shoots out multiple homing Air Shooters.\n\cnItem will teleport you to another part of the map while leaving Air Shooters.","",""},
{"SinfulBusterExpert","\cmSinful \cuBusterExpert","M_UB102","Street Fighter Alpha 3 - Final M. Bison's Theme","The power of all the sins are yours to control...\n\cdUse your rage by pressing altfire.\n\cnUse your item to swap weapons!","",""},
{"SirAlpha","\ciA\cmlpha","M_UB103","Fire Emblem Seisen no Keifu - Versus Yurius","Hmph, How old fashioned, I'll dance around my enemies if I have to.\n\ckPrimary Attack, A cutting slash. Close-Ranged.\n\cdAlternative Attack, Alphan-Slash. Long-Ranged \n\cnSpecial Attack, Rising Upper. It's an uppercut.","Cc","prepares for a brawl"},
{"SadFaceToadMan","\cdToadman","M_UB104","Pokemon Colosseum: Miror B.'s Retro Groove","You are the saddest Toadman alive. You only want to be praised.\n\ckCry acid tears\cj but people will stop you.\n\cdHop Hop Hop\cj because you'll be Mad.","",""},
{"SuperFaggasso","\cfSuper \ccSpeciman","M_UB042 5","Earthbound Beginnings - Battle Against a Dangerous Foe","THE ECONOMY IS IN \cfGRAVE DANGER\cj. To save the economy, help others. \ckAssume\cj a powerful beam! \cdAssume\cj health insurance! \cnAssume\cj a protective shield!","C","draws near"},
{"GhostFaggasso","\ctGhost of Speciman","M_UB106","Earthbound - Battle Against a Machine","THE ECONOMY IS \ctDEAD\cj. To reanimate the economy, obtain insurance. \ckAssume\cj a menacing smile..? But better yet, \ckAssume\cj a pin-point meteor storm! Enough points on \cdcredit card\cj means \cgdeadly meteors\cj!","C","draws near"},
{"RogueDX","\ctRogue","M_UB107","Megaman Starforce 2 - Wave Battle","I do not need others... I need only the power of Mu to punish those who punished me.\nI can easily adjust my techniques with that new gadget I just made...\nMu granted me the power to conquer death if I come close to it.\nIf all else fails... then they will taste the fury of \ctROGUEBREAK\cj.","",""},
{"GBeast","\c[UB108]G-Beast","M_UB108Z","Mega Man Battle Network 4.5 - Net Battle 1","Primary: Gregar Buster. It fires fast!\nItem switches your cross.\nAlt for Cross attacks, you have five of them.\nRage: \cgPrimal Beast-Over!","C","thrashes onto the scene"},
{"FBeast","\c[UB109]F-Beast","M_UB108Z","Mega Man Battle Network 4.5 - Net Battle 1","Primary: Falzar Buster. Fire sharp feathers in bursts!\nItem switches your cross.\nAlt for Cross attacks, you have five of them.\nRage: \cgPrimal Beast-Over!","C","swoops onto the scene"},
//110//FGBEAST Megaman Battle Network 6 - Boss Battle
{"TropicalMWS","\ckTropical \ckMWS","M_UB110","Advance Wars - Dual Strike: Grimm's Theme","\ckFire coconuts! Slide on what they leave behind!\n\cdAltfire illegal pineapple juice!\n\cnItem for \cgrage\cn! Make people chill out!\n\cjRad moves are to find out on your own!","C","requires a cow, man"},
{"DLCCentaurman","\cdDLC Centaurman","M_UB111 2","Jetter - Summer Carnival 92: Recca","Congratulations, you have purchased some fancy horse armor. But it was sold out so here’s a centaur instead.\n\ckMainfire fires a spread of arrows, or an explosive arrow if you have full power.\n\cnUse your item to enter another dimension and press \ckMain \cnto fire a trick shot or \cdAlt\cn to return to reality with a boom.\n\cjWith full \cgrage\cj, Press \cdAlt\cj to stop time. Press \ckMain\cj to fire arrows or \cdAlt\cj to place bombs- these will trigger when time returns to normal.","",""},
{"Clownpiece","\ctClownpiece","M_UB112","TrojanHorse711 - Pierrot of the Star Spangled Banner","\ckMainfire will shot a left-to-right star spread!\n\cdUse your altfire to shot lasers!\n\cjIf you get angry, dont waste time and \ckuse\cj your \cgrage\cj!","",""},
{"Scrotoman","\chScrotoman","M_UB113","The Simpsons: Hit & Run - Hit and Run (Sped Up)","\ckPrimary is chargeable!\n\cnItem turns people into \crUGLY \cgPROTOMEN\c-!\n\cdAltfire to perform a jolt haymaker!","Ck.","shows up, just because he can"},
{"GraniteMauler","\caGranite Mauler","M_UB114","Runescape - Victory is Mine (Sped-up)","They call me The Mauler.\nI am cheap but clearly the best.\nDropping stacks like the legends before me.\nWith my maximum damage, everyone will sit.","",""},
{"MagicDevilEye","\ctMagic \caSpecialist","M_UB115","VinylCheese - Rude Buster (Kirby NES Style)","Surprise, surprise! It is I, the notorious demon-devil \ctMagic \caspecialist\cj!\nTo cause havoc is in my veins, enough to ruin their day!\nA wand such as this can cast all sorts of disruptive magic!\nA blast to get them dazed by the glimmering stars or\n\cgcrush their entire life away.\cj.\nTrust me! For my big magic trick will surely blow you away!\n\ccQuite literally...\c-.","B","read a book and became a"},//"\ca<O> \cjSpectacular Wonders! \ca<O>"
{"BlueThwomp","\chBlue Thwomp","M_UB116","Super Mario 64 - Main Theme - Bob-Omb Battlefield","Urg","",""},
{"Joterra","\cdJoterra","M_UB117","Gh0st - Jojo's Bizzare Adventure","Yare yare daze.\nHow did I end up here?\nThe ability of \cdSTAR CHASER\c- and \cdORIGINAL PLATINUM'S COMET FIST\c- allows me to hit foes out of the range of my stand.\n\nChanneling the power of \cdORIGINAL PLATINUM\c-, it lands devastating blows on foes caught by it and aids me in tricky situations.\n\nThey would rather die quickly than to face \cdORIGINAL PLATINUM'S WRATH\c-.","F","Yare Yare Daze, \cdJoterra\c- approaches"},

