{"EyelentoMajor","\cuEyelento Major","M_UB401","Final Fight Arcade - Rolento's Theme","\ckMainfire\cj for baton spin.\n\cdAltfire\cj for grenades.\n\cnItem\cj tosses a hat to recruit allies!","",""},
{"FinalSampi","\crSampi","M_UB402","Mario & Luigi: Superstar Saga - Final Cackletta Battle","I expect you to follow these instructions \cgCLEARLY\cj.\n\ckPrimary Fire:\cj Sampi Wave. \n\cdAlternative Fire:\cj Forlorn Fist. \n\cnSeven different items, seven different uses. Let alone for \cgYOU\cn to find out.","Ec!","This is it...it's"},
