{"FinalFaggasso","\crFinal Speciman","M_UB404","Super Smash Brothers - Master Hand Battle","OUR INTELLIGENCE ASSUMES SUPERIORITY. \crLEGENDARY ASSUMING!\n\ckAssume\cj a pin-point meteor..which can become more powerful!\n\cdAssume\cj a blast..or a shield..or even a death killing pin-point flash!\n\cnAssume a killer thunder attack in secret..!\n\cgLegendary Assume!","C","assumed to draw near"},

